clojure-core-tests — the portable part of Clojure's own test suite (design §10, "Критерий приёмки ядра")

Repository: https://github.com/clojure/clojure
Tag:        clojure-1.12.6 (the version docs/api-parity.md names, so the suite and the API diff
            describe the same Clojure)
License:    Eclipse Public License 1.0 (LICENSE; the repository ships it as epl-v10.html, and every
            file keeps its own copyright header)

Files taken, unmodified (the nine files design §10 names, plus the in-tree helpers they require):
  test/clojure/test_helper.clj                    -> test/clojure/test_helper.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/control.clj           -> test/clojure/test_clojure/control.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/data_structures.clj   -> test/clojure/test_clojure/data_structures.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/def.clj               -> test/clojure/test_clojure/def.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/fn.clj                -> test/clojure/test_clojure/fn.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/generators.clj        -> test/clojure/test_clojure/generators.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/logic.clj             -> test/clojure/test_clojure/logic.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/macros.clj            -> test/clojure/test_clojure/macros.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/numbers.clj           -> test/clojure/test_clojure/numbers.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/sequences.clj         -> test/clojure/test_clojure/sequences.clj
  test/clojure/test_clojure/string.clj            -> test/clojure/test_clojure/string.clj

Not taken: every other file of test/clojure/test_clojure/. The rule and the per-file reasons are in
docs/notes/corpus.md, "Clojure's own suite: what is in and what is out".

shim/ is ours, not Clojure's: stand-ins for the three support namespaces the nine files require and the
JVM test tooling supplies (clojure.data.generators, clojure.test.generative, clojure.test.check.*) plus an
empty clojure.test-clojure.protocols, so a file's own (ns ...) form loads instead of taking the whole file
down with it. Each shim file says what it stands in for.
